            "review_title": "Review at Peach Garden Vietnam",
            "review_text": "biastap\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam19 contributions\n0\nEvery dish is exquisite; the ambience elegant yet family-friendly\nJun 2019 • Family\nWe love Peach Garden at Landmark 81, Ho Chi Minh City. We come here very often as we live in the same building, and have the same friendly experience each time. Our kids are made to feel welcome here too plus there’s a lot of choice for them to enjoy. \nThe restaurant has many vegetarian options and their jasmine tea is high quality. Their portions are generous and simply delicious. \nWe are lucky to have this restaurant as our neighborhood spot for a family breakfast (on weekends they serve b’fast from 9:30am) or lunch or an elegant dinner.\nRead more\nWritten June 1, 2019",
