            "review_title": "Review at Peach Garden Vietnam",
            "review_text": "nickndt\nSuwanee, Georgia1 contribution\n0\nWorst service\nFeb 2019 • Friends\nWe visited another Chinese restaurant (Lai restaurant)for lunch and was so impressed with the service that I came here with high hope because it locates in a nice new area. But unfortunately it’s the worst restaurant we have ever been to. Service was extremely terrible and rude the moment we sat down. Our server did not introduce herself or anything about the menu of the restaurant. I even brought it up to the manager on duty but things just got even worst because It’s not just one person but the whole team. The whole team served with a big attitude. One would think such a big restaurant like this should have train their team on customer service. We travelled a lot and have been to over 25+ countries especially Hong-Kong since we love Cantonese food a lot, yet have never experienced this before. Very disappointing experience.\nRead more\nWritten February 3, 2019",
